# Interview site (always)

Static GitHub Pages repo. Preview from repo root: `python3 -m http.server 8765`.

## Surfaces

- Landing: `index.html`, `how-to-use.html`, `zerotohero/`, `social.html`, `assets/`
- Topic library: `interview/` (markdown modules + `Config/` + `app.js`)
- Animated course: `play/` (`lessons/*.js`, `engine/`, `app.js`, `tools/scan-layout.mjs`)

## Agent routing

For non-trivial work, read `AGENTS.md` then `.cursor/skills/interview-site/SKILL.md` and the matching specialist skill under `.cursor/skills/`.

## Hard rules

- Code MIT; original educational content All Rights Reserved unless a file says otherwise
- Do not invent exploit PoCs, malware, or attack runbooks; keep lessons defensive / interview-framed
- Commit only when the user asks; conventional commits; never Cursor co-author trailers
- Shared theme key: `localStorage["sd-theme"]` (`light` | `dark`)
- Prefer editing existing files over new docs the user did not ask for

## Local checks before claiming done

- Touched `play/lessons/*.js` → `node --check` on each file; wire `<script>` in `play/index.html` if new
- Layout complaints → `play-layout-scan` skill + `node play/tools/scan-layout.mjs <ids>`
- Topic Config / paths → `python3 interview/Scripts/check_topics_contract.py` when relevant
